OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FMostly dry and cloudy, with     
OL,8,Flimited sunny breaks. Rain across      
OL,9,FScotland will ease, except in the      
OL,10,Fnortheast, and showers will arrive for 
OL,11,Fthe northwest. Some drizzle in the far 
OL,12,Fsouth later. Feeling cold,             
OL,13,Fparticularly along the windy North Sea 
OL,14,Fcoasts.                                
OL,16,GTonight:FShowers will persist along    
OL,17,Fsome Scottish coasts, and will also    
OL,18,Farrive in northeast England. Cold and  
OL,19,Fmostly cloudy. Under any clear spells, 
OL,20,Ftemperatures will fall further to      
OL,21,Fbring frost.                           
